== Description ==
Offline production increases, charge all non-shards spells by 1%

Gains experience every second, more if idle mode is off. Doesn't gain experience offline.

== Pet Abilities ==

Charges all non-shard spells by 1% every 10 seconds.

Multiplies Offline production by:
<br><math>L^{1.29} \times P \times 5 + 1</math>


where:
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Gains experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>(2 + F) \times M \times I</math>

where:
* <math>I = 5 \iff \text{Idle Mode Off}\  \and\  I = 1 \iff \text{Idle Mode On}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

